      <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-7026-7050"><rb>彼女</rb><rt>かのぢよ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-7050-7056">は、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-7056-7080"><rb>片山</rb><rt>かたやま</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-7080-7101"><rb>一人</rb><rt>ひとり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-7101-7104">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-7104-7116"><rb>得</rb><rt>う</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-7116-7119">る</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-7119-7134"><rb>爲</rb><rt>ため</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-7134-7143">には、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-7143-7164"><rb>過去</rb><rt>くわこ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-7164-7170">の一</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-7170-7188"><rb>切</rb><rt>さい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-7188-7191">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-7191-7203"><rb>棄</rb><rt>す</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-7203-7212">てた。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-7212-7236"><rb>肉親</rb><rt>にくしん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-7236-7242">とも</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-7242-7254"><rb>絶</rb><rt>た</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-7254-7305">たなければならなかつた。もつとも、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-7305-7329"><rb>母親</rb><rt>はゝおや</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-7329-7332">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-7332-7353"><rb>實母</rb><rt>じつぼ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-7353-7376">ではなかつた。</seg></p>
